1
00:01:09,020 --> 00:01:11,290
I said I'd pay you back.

2
00:01:11,290 --> 00:01:14,470
I'm working to pay you back.

3
00:01:14,470 --> 00:01:17,180
Why are you harassing me like this?

4
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:19,320
Are you going to tell them that I'm a murderer?

5
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:21,180
Do you want them to kick me out?

6
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:22,980
Why are you doing this to me?

7
00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:26,510
Do you think I'm that kind of person?

8
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:31,620
Right. Whatever.

9
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:38,010
Anyway, let's go back.

10
00:01:41,130 --> 00:01:43,510
Let me go! Let me go!

11
00:01:43,510 --> 00:01:44,780
Let's go back.

12
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:47,240
Let me go. What are you doing? Are you crazy?

13
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:49,270
Yes, I'm crazy.

14
00:01:49,270 --> 00:01:50,680
I'm crazy missing you.

15
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:54,280
Stay with me.

16
00:02:19,220 --> 00:02:22,720
If you don't stay with me, I'll spread rumors about you.

17
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:25,670
I'll follow you everywhere you go.

18
00:02:25,670 --> 00:02:27,340
If that can make you stay with me,

19
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:28,300
I'll do that.

20
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:30,670
Why?

21
00:02:30,670 --> 00:02:33,410
You said you hate to see me. Why are you doing this?

22
00:02:33,410 --> 00:02:38,010
You were with Ahn Do Hoon on that day.

23
00:02:40,790 --> 00:02:47,550
I'm curious what did you do that day.

24
00:02:48,210 --> 00:02:52,320
Don't try to run away from me.

25
00:03:02,230 --> 00:03:04,150
Is that a good reason?

26
00:03:04,150 --> 00:03:06,890
He has nothing to do with me.

27
00:03:06,890 --> 00:03:13,030
Then, you don't care what I do to Ahn Do Hoon?

28
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,400
It's me.

29
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:28,610
Fire Ahn Do Hoon right away.

30
00:03:28,610 --> 00:03:30,240
No reason! Do as I say!

31
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:33,840
- Sir! - Call other firms and tell them not to hire him.

32
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,750
What are you doing?

33
00:03:35,750 --> 00:03:38,050
Why?

34
00:03:38,570 --> 00:03:42,400
What does he mean to you?

35
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:45,620
Tell me.

36
00:04:49,110 --> 00:04:51,560
Get off.

37
00:04:52,690 --> 00:04:54,280
Is this where you wanted to take me?

38
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:57,310
Go to work tomorrow.

39
00:04:57,310 --> 00:04:58,090
What?

40
00:04:58,090 --> 00:05:03,630
Go to the western restaurant as usual.

41
00:05:03,630 --> 00:05:05,950
Get off.

42
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:36,310
We're going to donate the money wecollect from the wedding to the Shina Gallery.

43
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:42,440
I think the K Corporation should do the same, for the company's reputation.

44
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:44,830
We pay for the wedding ceremony,

45
00:05:44,830 --> 00:05:49,660
and donate the money to the Shina Gallery?

46
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:53,350
You chose chinaware from Germany.

47
00:05:53,350 --> 00:05:55,560
How much do you need?

48
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:59,810
We have about 1,000 guests.

49
00:05:59,810 --> 00:06:02,090
You should choose something like this,

50
00:06:02,090 --> 00:06:03,740
just like we do,

51
00:06:03,740 --> 00:06:07,540
you have a unique taste, don't you?

52
00:06:07,540 --> 00:06:13,680
I don't want to see your friends at the wedding ceremony.

53
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:18,360
I can't invite my friends to my son's wedding?

54
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:20,720
If you were Min Hyuk's real mother,

55
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:23,970
I wouldn't have said that.

56
00:06:23,970 --> 00:06:25,980
That's what you two should decide.

57
00:06:25,980 --> 00:06:27,750
It has nothign to do with me.

58
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:28,960
If you'll excuse me.

59
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:30,360
Min Hyuk.

60
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:33,600
All I have to do is to attend the wedding ceremony, right?

61
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:36,420
Mother.

62
00:06:53,250 --> 00:06:55,890
What? How can she get back?

63
00:06:55,890 --> 00:06:58,630
The CEO told the manager to hire her back.

64
00:06:58,630 --> 00:07:02,150
That's why he looked a little down.

65
00:07:02,150 --> 00:07:06,130
How does she know the CEO?

66
00:07:09,870 --> 00:07:14,120
Welcome. Thank you for coming.

67
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:24,400
Hey! Driver! Get in!

68
00:07:33,460 --> 00:07:36,040
I said get in!

69
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:39,750
Yoo Jung, he's offering us a ride. Don't refuse it.

70
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:45,090
Let's get in. Let's go. Thanks.

71
00:07:59,370 --> 00:08:03,650
Wow! This car is really nice. Isn't it, Yoo Jung?

72
00:08:03,650 --> 00:08:06,900
You drive so well.

73
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:10,350
Is there anything you can't do?

74
00:08:11,420 --> 00:08:14,180
By the way, Mr. Jo, how did you meet Yoo Jung?

75
00:08:14,180 --> 00:08:16,960
Hae Ri.

76
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:20,060
Stop talking please.

77
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:28,220
By the way, did you thank him?

78
00:08:28,220 --> 00:08:29,830
For what?

79
00:08:29,830 --> 00:08:31,230
He scolded the manager for firing you

80
00:08:31,230 --> 00:08:36,040
and asked him to bring you back.

81
00:08:36,830 --> 00:08:40,050
He said, "How can a manager don't believe his employee?"

82
00:08:40,050 --> 00:08:44,450
He looked so cool.

83
00:08:57,460 --> 00:08:59,170
Have dinner with us.

84
00:08:59,170 --> 00:09:01,830
You drove us here. Have dinner with us.

85
00:09:01,830 --> 00:09:05,500
Hae Ri, they're not eating here.

86
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:07,220
You can go.

87
00:09:07,220 --> 00:09:10,740
Sir, Yoo Jung is an excellent cook.

88
00:09:10,740 --> 00:09:13,550
You'll regret it if you don't try it.

89
00:09:13,550 --> 00:09:17,850
I'll not have dinner here, I need to talk to you.

90
00:09:20,410 --> 00:09:22,380
Ha.

91
00:09:22,380 --> 00:09:24,930
Hey.

92
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:45,740
You said you wanted to talk to me.

93
00:09:45,740 --> 00:09:46,920
Don't you want to say something?

94
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:50,140
I don't know what you want me to say.

95
00:09:50,140 --> 00:09:52,330
But I have nothing to say.

96
00:09:52,330 --> 00:09:55,780
Then don't say anything, I'll find it out.

97
00:09:55,780 --> 00:09:56,850
There's nothing for you to find out.

98
00:09:56,850 --> 00:09:59,060
Okay. Keep saying that.

99
00:09:59,060 --> 00:10:02,450
- Sir! - That bakery. The location isn't great, and the location isn't great,

100
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:07,410
I can't sell it anyway.

101
00:10:07,410 --> 00:10:10,540
The longer I have it, the more money I lose.

102
00:10:11,140 --> 00:10:15,700
Pay off your debt and take it back.

103
00:10:26,150 --> 00:10:27,340
Kwang Soo.

104
00:10:27,340 --> 00:10:29,550
Yes.

105
00:10:31,990 --> 00:10:33,250
Let's go.

106
00:10:33,250 --> 00:10:36,220
How rude he is to our home

107
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:38,220
while we are eating.

108
00:10:45,030 --> 00:10:48,240
Min Hyuk!

109
00:10:52,660 --> 00:10:54,700
Min Hyuk!

110
00:11:25,070 --> 00:11:26,790
What are you doing?

111
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:33,590
Your tuxedo is ready. Try it on.

112
00:11:37,340 --> 00:11:39,610
I told you not to touch that.

113
00:11:42,930 --> 00:11:47,780
When your father threw everything that belonged to your mother away...

114
00:11:47,780 --> 00:11:50,840
I was the one who kept this.

115
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:55,620
So? Do you want me to thank you?

116
00:11:57,240 --> 00:12:04,720
No. I just wanted to listen to it.

117
00:12:32,810 --> 00:12:35,810
Are you sure he wanted to meet us here?

118
00:12:35,810 --> 00:12:41,790
Yes, his secretary called me to have dinner here.

119
00:12:41,790 --> 00:12:44,800
- He has a secretary! - Okay.

120
00:12:45,370 --> 00:12:47,110
Sit up straight.

121
00:12:47,110 --> 00:12:50,520
Our son works here. Don't be intimidated.

122
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:56,130
Oh my god! Who is this?

123
00:12:58,280 --> 00:13:03,090
-Hello. - Did Do Hoon invite you as well?

124
00:13:03,090 --> 00:13:06,880
No, it's actually me who invite you two here.

125
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:13,620
- Se Yeon. - Sorry I didn't tell you in advance.

126
00:13:13,620 --> 00:13:17,650
I really enjoyed the dinner the other night. I want to treat you in return.

127
00:13:18,540 --> 00:13:21,060
You don't have to do this.

128
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:24,860
I relly enjoyed that. I really want to join you,

129
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:27,320
but I still have some work to do at the moment.

130
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:32,000
- Enjoy your meal. - Thank you.

131
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:41,580
She looks very charming.

132
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:44,060
What on earth does she do?

133
00:13:44,060 --> 00:13:48,360
She is well educated, and she's polite to us.

134
00:13:57,820 --> 00:14:01,470
The hard drive is damaged, so it'll be hard to check the black box records

135
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:05,530
I think I know who did it. But I don't have evidence now.

136
00:14:05,530 --> 00:14:08,070
You must be curious what's on there as well.

137
00:14:08,110 --> 00:14:10,470
- Yes. - Then recover it.

138
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:25,920
Ah! Do Hoon! Did you touch other files in the Security Room?

139
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,520
What do you mean?

140
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:30,210
I heard that some data was damaged.

141
00:14:30,210 --> 00:14:33,220
Min Hyuk asked the tech team to recover it.

142
00:14:33,220 --> 00:14:35,780
What were you looking for that day?

143
00:14:36,270 --> 00:14:40,100
I don't know what you are talking about.

144
00:14:40,100 --> 00:14:43,260
I only looked at the files related to Pyeongchang Construction.

145
00:14:43,260 --> 00:14:45,320
- Really? - Yes.

146
00:15:08,690 --> 00:15:11,910
- You don't have to come with me. - I'll escort you to the airport.

147
00:15:12,310 --> 00:15:15,400
- No. - Sir.

148
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:21,430
- Don't worry about me. Take good care of Min Hyuk when I'm not here. - Yes, sir.

149
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:26,340
And...

150
00:15:29,730 --> 00:15:35,340
About Ahn Do Hoon. Don't overpraise him,

151
00:15:36,670 --> 00:15:40,440
we need to be able to beat him when we need to.

152
00:15:40,930 --> 00:15:46,630
Get ready for that.

153
00:15:46,630 --> 00:15:48,970
Let's go.

154
00:16:01,330 --> 00:16:03,420
What did he say?

155
00:16:04,050 --> 00:16:06,660
He's the head of the K Corporation.

156
00:16:06,660 --> 00:16:09,610
He needs to take care of everything.

157
00:16:09,610 --> 00:16:13,040
- Is everything okay with your tasting event? - Yes.

158
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:35,130
- Here are the plates. - Can you bring somethign for me?

159
00:16:35,130 --> 00:16:36,580
Okay.

160
00:16:37,670 --> 00:16:40,050
This is today's guest list.

161
00:16:51,580 --> 00:16:54,530
- Did Kang Yoo Jung come to work today? - Yes.

162
00:16:56,010 --> 00:16:57,850
Let's go.

163
00:16:58,040 --> 00:17:01,960
- Here are the new dishes. - Here you are.

164
00:17:02,500 --> 00:17:04,880
- Give that to me. - This one?

165
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:07,200
- Yoo Jung. - Yes.

166
00:17:07,710 --> 00:17:09,900
Mr. Jo is here to see you.

167
00:17:12,460 --> 00:17:14,070
What does he want?

168
00:17:19,520 --> 00:17:22,200
I'll pay you for the day. Go home!

169
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:26,500
- Sir! - You don't have to work today. Just go.

170
00:17:26,500 --> 00:17:28,590
People are speaking ill of me

171
00:17:28,590 --> 00:17:31,130
because you brought me here.

172
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,190
Sinc I'm working here,

173
00:17:34,190 --> 00:17:36,370
I don't want anything else happened.

174
00:17:36,370 --> 00:17:38,520
Driver, just listen to me.

175
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:41,910
I don't work and get paid. Why should I do that?

176
00:17:46,860 --> 00:17:49,960
- The guests have arrived. - I have to work.

177
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:52,900
Hey! Driver!

178
00:17:53,230 --> 00:17:55,850
Mr. Jo.

179
00:17:56,440 --> 00:18:00,010
- Welcome. - Haven't seen you for a long time.

180
00:18:00,730 --> 00:18:02,700
Okay.

181
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:06,800
Don't let Kang Yoo Jung serve today.

182
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:09,640
- Well... - What?

183
00:18:19,980 --> 00:18:22,120
- Think about it. - Okay.

184
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:24,420
Your ribs are ready.

185
00:18:32,130 --> 00:18:34,340
- Do you work here? - Yes.

186
00:18:37,210 --> 00:18:39,220
I'll cut it for you.

187
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:47,270
What are the qualifications for working here?

188
00:18:50,690 --> 00:18:54,460
I don't know, sorry.

189
00:18:55,900 --> 00:18:59,190
I guess you don't know what shame is.

190
00:19:01,820 --> 00:19:03,960
Why don't we talk about the food?

191
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:07,550
This is a tasting event. We're not evaluating our employees.

192
00:19:08,660 --> 00:19:11,270
If you're done here, you can go.

193
00:19:12,530 --> 00:19:13,930
I told you to go.

194
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:35,370
Yoo Jung, is that Do Hoon?

195
00:19:36,420 --> 00:19:39,530
Oh my god! It drives me crazy.

196
00:19:39,530 --> 00:19:42,480
How is this possible?

197
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:45,070
Yoo Jung, stay here! I'll go.

198
00:19:45,070 --> 00:19:46,840
Hae Ri, bring me some water.

199
00:19:46,840 --> 00:19:48,040
Okay.

200
00:19:51,430 --> 00:19:52,780
Yoo Jung.

201
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:06,830
I thought you'd quit.

202
00:20:09,550 --> 00:20:11,860
Something happened.

203
00:20:12,590 --> 00:20:14,540
Besides, it's not easy for me to get a job elsewhere.

204
00:20:14,540 --> 00:20:19,690
So you take the job he offerd no matter how bad he is?

205
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:22,920
You don't know who Jo Min Hyuk is?

206
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:25,020
You don't know why he's keeping you around?

207
00:20:25,020 --> 00:20:26,020
Do Hoon.

208
00:20:26,020 --> 00:20:29,610
I do hate him.

209
00:20:29,640 --> 00:20:31,500
I heard about the parole thing.

210
00:20:31,500 --> 00:20:33,810
I know everything.

211
00:20:33,810 --> 00:20:35,320
Can't you think for me?

212
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:39,360
Don't you know why I'm here even I have known everything?

213
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:41,370
Parole?

214
00:20:42,370 --> 00:20:44,490
What are you talking about?

215
00:20:44,740 --> 00:20:46,260
Okay.

216
00:20:46,390 --> 00:20:48,500
It's none of your business.

217
00:20:48,500 --> 00:20:50,300
I have to work.

218
00:20:50,300 --> 00:20:53,050
What are you talking about?

219
00:20:53,220 --> 00:20:54,940
Get out of the way.

220
00:20:55,620 --> 00:20:58,610
I won't bother you again.

221
00:21:00,450 --> 00:21:05,430
The fact that you're working here

222
00:21:05,430 --> 00:21:07,510
is making my life very difficult.

223
00:21:07,510 --> 00:21:10,840
Is there a reason why I shouldn't work here?

224
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:14,120
The fact that he knows about our relationship?

225
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:15,850
So what?

226
00:21:15,850 --> 00:21:17,970
What about it?

227
00:21:17,970 --> 00:21:19,690
I have nothing to do with you now.

228
00:21:19,690 --> 00:21:21,560
You.

229
00:21:22,830 --> 00:21:25,540
Everytime I see you, I suffered a lot.

230
00:21:26,450 --> 00:21:29,090
Everytime you stand in front of me,

231
00:21:29,090 --> 00:21:33,300
it just makes me sick.

232
00:21:52,090 --> 00:21:53,870
Your facilities are perfect.

233
00:21:53,870 --> 00:21:56,050
The employees are effective.

234
00:21:56,050 --> 00:21:58,730
Stop harrassing Kang Yoo Jung.

235
00:21:58,920 --> 00:22:02,790
You said you have nothing to do with her.

236
00:22:08,050 --> 00:22:14,280
I'm wondering why do you keep Yoo Jung near you.

237
00:22:15,760 --> 00:22:18,280
I told you,

238
00:22:18,900 --> 00:22:21,280
I fall in love with her.

239
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:24,930
The more I know her, the more I find her interesting.

240
00:22:24,930 --> 00:22:26,670
I'm curious.

241
00:22:26,670 --> 00:22:28,760
You're curious.

242
00:22:29,360 --> 00:22:30,850
Curiosity is always a problem.

243
00:22:30,850 --> 00:22:33,280
I'll take care of my employee.

244
00:22:33,280 --> 00:22:36,840
It's none of your business now.

245
00:22:38,430 --> 00:22:40,680
Have you said enough?

246
00:22:44,080 --> 00:22:46,100
I have something to tell you.

247
00:22:58,910 --> 00:23:01,030
Choose one.

248
00:23:01,030 --> 00:23:03,110
That's the least you can do.

249
00:23:03,110 --> 00:23:05,690
It's our weeding, not mine.

250
00:23:09,270 --> 00:23:13,210
What's your relationship with that woman?

251
00:23:13,210 --> 00:23:15,680
You don't need to know.

252
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:19,790
This marriage is just a business deal.

253
00:23:38,230 --> 00:23:39,740
Hey! Driver!

254
00:23:46,190 --> 00:23:49,870
You were off work so early, why do you come home so late?

255
00:23:51,140 --> 00:23:53,570
I didn't do it on purpose.

256
00:23:53,570 --> 00:23:56,450
You must think I did it.

257
00:23:57,930 --> 00:24:03,430
I used to do it.

258
00:24:03,600 --> 00:24:05,920
But not this time.

259
00:24:07,190 --> 00:24:09,870
Don't get mad at me.

260
00:24:10,550 --> 00:24:15,310
You should've left when I told you to.

261
00:24:15,310 --> 00:24:18,200
Thank you for your concern

262
00:24:19,620 --> 00:24:21,470
Good night.

263
00:24:27,560 --> 00:24:31,630
Not long after we met,

264
00:24:31,630 --> 00:24:34,360
You dumped me.

265
00:24:34,360 --> 00:24:37,380
You dumped me.

266
00:24:38,380 --> 00:24:41,950
It's a lie. It's a lie.

267
00:24:41,950 --> 00:24:46,160
It's a lie. It's a lie.

268
00:24:46,580 --> 00:24:48,880
Yoo Jung!

269
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:51,170
My sweet Yoo Jung!

270
00:24:51,170 --> 00:24:52,570
Have a seat!

271
00:24:52,570 --> 00:24:57,960
I bought a bottel of expensive dry wine from China.

272
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:58,800
Drink some!

273
00:24:58,800 --> 00:25:02,510
You only brought one bottle.

274
00:25:02,510 --> 00:25:07,240
Drink it! For we failed to sell the bags.

275
00:25:07,240 --> 00:25:09,250
I'm so depressed.

276
00:25:09,250 --> 00:25:16,050
I'm really sad and depressed. How can I make a living?

277
00:25:16,050 --> 00:25:19,690
We can drink wine.

278
00:25:29,840 --> 00:25:33,240
Eat it.

279
00:25:33,330 --> 00:25:36,660
Eat this and drink up.

280
00:25:37,730 --> 00:25:46,100
Men's hearts are easy to change.

281
00:25:46,100 --> 00:25:50,230
They would be cruel when they don't love you.

282
00:25:50,230 --> 00:25:54,050
But it's weird that we women would feel lonely when they are not here.

283
00:25:54,050 --> 00:25:56,600
If they are here I would be happy.

284
00:25:56,600 --> 00:26:00,150
Men are annoying. Right?

285
00:26:00,150 --> 00:26:01,610
Sure.

286
00:26:01,610 --> 00:26:04,630
If I can support myself, I don't need a man.

287
00:26:04,630 --> 00:26:09,040
I don't care whether love changes or not.

288
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:13,880
Love doesn't change. People change.

289
00:26:13,880 --> 00:26:18,870
So you should find a good person.

290
00:27:45,780 --> 00:27:46,920
Hello.

291
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:48,460
Yoo Jung.

292
00:27:48,460 --> 00:27:49,650
How are you?

293
00:27:49,650 --> 00:27:52,470
What are you doing here so late?

294
00:27:53,310 --> 00:27:56,910
Is this your shop's recipe?

295
00:27:56,910 --> 00:27:58,720
Right.

296
00:27:58,720 --> 00:28:00,970
This is my father's jacket.

297
00:28:00,970 --> 00:28:06,790
Your father always came here to buy a cream cake.

298
00:28:06,790 --> 00:28:10,950
He lived here his entire life.

299
00:28:10,950 --> 00:28:16,480
Whenever he came, his nurse came with him.

300
00:28:16,480 --> 00:28:20,640
But he came alone that day.

301
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:23,860
Your father looked better.

302
00:28:23,860 --> 00:28:27,590
He recognized me and looked really good.

303
00:28:27,590 --> 00:28:30,340
Are you sure that was the same day?

304
00:28:30,340 --> 00:28:34,200
I'm not sure.

305
00:28:35,750 --> 00:28:42,380
It was pouring down, and a guy came and picked him up.

306
00:28:42,380 --> 00:28:45,550
I thought it was your fiance.

307
00:29:19,570 --> 00:29:23,600
You are really free, you even have time to read.

308
00:29:24,750 --> 00:29:26,340
Thanks to you.

309
00:29:27,750 --> 00:29:31,970
Don't think that you can

310
00:29:31,970 --> 00:29:33,200
control me using the board members.

311
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:35,700
I told you that wasn't it.

312
00:29:35,700 --> 00:29:36,690
The board already decided....

313
00:29:36,690 --> 00:29:39,190
I don't care.

314
00:29:39,190 --> 00:29:42,730
I don't care even if they dismiss me unanimously,

315
00:29:42,750 --> 00:29:44,450
it's about you,

316
00:29:44,450 --> 00:29:45,730
at least you should support me.

317
00:29:45,730 --> 00:29:46,430
Min Hyuk!

318
00:29:46,430 --> 00:29:47,970
I warned you,

319
00:29:47,970 --> 00:29:50,540
not to get Do Hoon involved.

320
00:29:52,300 --> 00:29:53,980
We

321
00:29:55,030 --> 00:29:57,800
are not even friendes anymore.

322
00:29:59,380 --> 00:30:01,410
Get out of my room.

323
00:30:27,710 --> 00:30:29,530
Let's go.

324
00:30:31,010 --> 00:30:32,070
What?

325
00:30:32,070 --> 00:30:34,460
Min Hyuk wants you to work at his place today.

326
00:30:35,290 --> 00:30:37,900
I've already called the restaurant.

327
00:30:37,900 --> 00:30:39,910
I can't just miss work.

328
00:30:39,910 --> 00:30:42,280
Tell him that I went to the restaurant.

329
00:30:58,200 --> 00:31:00,670
- She's here. - Okay.

330
00:31:06,050 --> 00:31:07,410
Why did you bring me here?

331
00:31:07,410 --> 00:31:09,100
You're my employee.

332
00:31:09,100 --> 00:31:11,170
- Work here today. - What?

333
00:31:11,170 --> 00:31:13,270
The people who work here went on a vacation,

334
00:31:13,270 --> 00:31:15,150
and this place is a mess.

335
00:31:15,150 --> 00:31:17,110
You need to fill in for them.

336
00:31:22,880 --> 00:31:25,440
Clean that up first.

337
00:31:53,340 --> 00:31:57,580
Who are you? Where is Yeongae?

338
00:32:02,690 --> 00:32:05,060
She's on a vacation.

339
00:32:05,060 --> 00:32:06,980
Vacation?

340
00:32:08,130 --> 00:32:10,120
I want to eat something spicy.

341
00:32:16,020 --> 00:32:19,300
It's delicious.

342
00:32:19,300 --> 00:32:22,110
Why don't you have some? It's really good.

343
00:32:23,270 --> 00:32:25,170
Have a seat.

344
00:32:27,200 --> 00:32:31,530
Have you eaten yet?

345
00:32:34,950 --> 00:32:36,670
Try it.

346
00:32:37,230 --> 00:32:41,460
Eat. Go ahead. Come on.

347
00:32:46,550 --> 00:32:49,670
- Isn't it good? - Yes.

348
00:32:51,070 --> 00:32:52,580
That's it?

349
00:32:52,580 --> 00:32:55,240
You're just like my brother. Boring.

350
00:32:58,120 --> 00:33:02,570
- Kwang Soo, what does Gwang Min like? - Excuse me?

351
00:33:02,570 --> 00:33:05,860
What does Gwang Min like to eat?

352
00:33:07,790 --> 00:33:11,450
Cup noodles. He likes cup noodles.

353
00:33:11,450 --> 00:33:13,920
What?

354
00:33:14,530 --> 00:33:18,420
He really enjoyed them when he was little.

355
00:33:28,110 --> 00:33:31,540
Min Hyuk! Try this.

356
00:33:31,540 --> 00:33:34,140
She's a really good cook.

357
00:33:41,660 --> 00:33:43,280
Bring me some coffee.

358
00:33:45,460 --> 00:33:48,130
Continue to eat.

359
00:33:48,750 --> 00:33:51,170
I had some while cooking.

360
00:33:51,170 --> 00:33:53,220
The coffee's in the kitchen, right?

361
00:34:06,540 --> 00:34:08,560
Where should I put it?

362
00:34:15,930 --> 00:34:19,880
I have finished cleaning, there is nothing I can do.

363
00:34:19,880 --> 00:34:22,310
If there's nothing to do, I'll leave.

364
00:34:22,310 --> 00:34:25,190
There must be something to do. Don't go!

365
00:34:35,110 --> 00:34:36,750
Bring it here.

366
00:34:40,280 --> 00:34:43,770
You have something to do. Read this.

367
00:34:45,370 --> 00:34:46,910
Take it.

368
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:51,490
I want to know how it ends, but I don't want to read it.

369
00:34:51,490 --> 00:34:54,540
Read it and write me a summary.

370
00:35:00,210 --> 00:35:02,780
Right now.

371
00:35:10,510 --> 00:35:17,730
Don't sit there. Go over there and read quietly.

372
00:35:51,470 --> 00:35:53,890
Wow, you do come here.

373
00:35:54,720 --> 00:35:56,980
Do you want me to come to see you like this?

374
00:35:56,980 --> 00:35:59,910
I can only show you this.

375
00:36:01,610 --> 00:36:04,710
What is upsetting you?

376
00:36:04,710 --> 00:36:07,410
Is this because you saw Min Hyuk today?

377
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:11,070
I thought your wedding plans were going well.

378
00:36:11,070 --> 00:36:13,850
It looks that way to other people.

379
00:36:13,850 --> 00:36:16,600
I feel like I'm drifting apart from him.

380
00:36:18,240 --> 00:36:21,370
You still want to have him even like this?

381
00:36:23,030 --> 00:36:25,800
I don't want to see you torture yourself

382
00:36:25,800 --> 00:36:27,690
because of Min Hyuk.

383
00:36:48,140 --> 00:36:50,040
Stop drinking.

384
00:36:50,480 --> 00:36:53,760
Why weren't you born in a wealthy family?

385
00:36:53,760 --> 00:36:56,460
As long as we are of equal status,

386
00:36:56,460 --> 00:37:00,300
I would've chosen you over Min Hyuk.

387
00:37:00,790 --> 00:37:03,640
No one can choose their parents.

388
00:37:04,290 --> 00:37:10,470
You can't choose your family members. Except your spouse.

389
00:37:11,210 --> 00:37:13,170
You know what?

390
00:37:13,170 --> 00:37:18,760
You gave up the only choice you had the right to make.

391
00:37:20,790 --> 00:37:25,220
If you want to drink, drink yourself.

392
00:37:27,630 --> 00:37:30,290
Ahn Do Hoon!

393
00:37:32,980 --> 00:37:34,760
Come here!

394
00:38:14,610 --> 00:38:18,680
Have a drink. It's for apologize.

395
00:38:18,680 --> 00:38:21,660
I'll call a designataed driver for you.

396
00:38:32,200 --> 00:38:36,050
Sir! Sir!

397
00:38:44,340 --> 00:38:46,610
- I'm leaving. - Okay.

398
00:38:46,610 --> 00:38:48,370
Come to work here tomorrow.

399
00:38:48,370 --> 00:38:50,340
- Sir. - Right. I'm your boss.

400
00:38:50,340 --> 00:38:53,030
- I'll see you tomorrow. - Okay

401
00:39:33,370 --> 00:39:40,200
Read it. And find out how revenge, which started because of love, ended.

402
00:39:52,870 --> 00:39:56,630
Though you owe his money he can't do this to you.

403
00:39:56,630 --> 00:40:00,160
I don't think he's doing this because of money.

404
00:40:00,160 --> 00:40:02,720
I don't think he wanted me there to torture me.

405
00:40:04,360 --> 00:40:09,310
Pull yourself together. Don't be fooled by that rich guy.

406
00:40:09,310 --> 00:40:11,510
Don't fall for it.

407
00:40:11,510 --> 00:40:14,190
By the way, when will you finish working there?

408
00:40:14,190 --> 00:40:18,470
The manager was unhappy about the dirty table.

409
00:40:18,470 --> 00:40:21,720
He was wondering if he should hire someone.

410
00:40:21,720 --> 00:40:23,870
I'll tell the boss tomorrow.

411
00:40:23,870 --> 00:40:25,900
This isn't right.

412
00:41:18,080 --> 00:41:19,820
Sir.

413
00:41:22,770 --> 00:41:24,260
Sir.

414
00:41:24,520 --> 00:41:26,010
Em.

415
00:41:45,990 --> 00:41:49,570
Someone already paid your bill.

416
00:42:15,560 --> 00:42:18,470
What are you doing here?

417
00:42:18,810 --> 00:42:20,350
This...

418
00:42:21,200 --> 00:42:24,130
I'm going to wash this.

419
00:42:24,270 --> 00:42:25,590
Excuse me.

420
00:42:28,620 --> 00:42:30,090
What?

421
00:42:30,580 --> 00:42:32,650
What's wrong with you?

422
00:42:42,810 --> 00:42:44,840
Thank you.

423
00:42:47,800 --> 00:42:49,730
For taking me to the hospital

424
00:42:51,170 --> 00:42:54,480
that day.

425
00:42:55,590 --> 00:42:59,160
You saved my life.

426
00:42:59,440 --> 00:43:01,090
Yes.

427
00:43:02,490 --> 00:43:05,850
You owe me.

428
00:43:08,000 --> 00:43:09,520
Go.

429
00:45:00,860 --> 00:45:04,770
What's this? Doesn't it smell nice?

430
00:45:05,240 --> 00:45:07,170
Coo...

431
00:45:07,510 --> 00:45:10,950
I hope we can see your father next month.

432
00:45:11,890 --> 00:45:15,920
Do you think we can see him?

433
00:45:31,900 --> 00:45:34,020
If there is nothing for me to do,

434
00:45:34,240 --> 00:45:36,120
I'll leave now.

435
00:45:37,360 --> 00:45:41,140
I'll go to the restaurant tomorrow.

436
00:45:41,590 --> 00:45:44,610
My colleagues are suffered because of me,

437
00:45:44,890 --> 00:45:47,030
I feel ashamed of that.

438
00:46:30,630 --> 00:46:32,990
Yoo Jung!

439
00:46:33,500 --> 00:46:34,350
Hey!

440
00:46:35,140 --> 00:46:37,400
How dare you come here?

441
00:46:40,770 --> 00:46:42,150
What?

442
00:46:42,340 --> 00:46:44,820
I want to beat her to death, why are you stopping me?

443
00:46:46,950 --> 00:46:49,110
I thought we were done talking.

444
00:46:49,410 --> 00:46:50,870
Why do you come here?

445
00:46:51,060 --> 00:46:53,810
What? You already talked to her?

446
00:46:53,980 --> 00:46:56,100
And you let her go?

447
00:46:56,910 --> 00:46:58,500
Yoo Jung.

448
00:46:59,660 --> 00:47:01,720
I'm so sorry.

449
00:47:02,210 --> 00:47:07,190
I was so shocked,

450
00:47:07,500 --> 00:47:09,730
and I can't sleep at night. I keep thinking of San.

451
00:47:10,060 --> 00:47:12,870
I'm so sorry.

452
00:47:13,060 --> 00:47:16,300
I would regret it all my life without apologizing for you.

453
00:47:16,510 --> 00:47:18,890
If you knew you were wrong,

454
00:47:19,040 --> 00:47:20,300
How can you treat San like that?

455
00:47:20,500 --> 00:47:22,400
How can you even mention San?

456
00:47:22,590 --> 00:47:24,220
I didn't know this'd happen.

457
00:47:24,380 --> 00:47:25,250
I mean it.

458
00:47:25,470 --> 00:47:26,940
Stop yelling!

459
00:47:27,160 --> 00:47:28,890
San was bruised all over.

460
00:47:29,130 --> 00:47:30,550
How could you do that to him?

461
00:47:30,730 --> 00:47:32,250
No, it's not like that.

462
00:47:32,410 --> 00:47:34,030
It's not like that.

463
00:47:34,180 --> 00:47:37,280
Stop, please.

464
00:47:42,410 --> 00:47:48,210
Not knowing doesn't make it okay.

465
00:47:49,000 --> 00:47:51,260
Yoo Jung.

466
00:48:09,260 --> 00:48:12,860
I'm waiting at the door.

467
00:48:35,810 --> 00:48:38,370
I thought you didn't want to see me again.

468
00:48:39,250 --> 00:48:40,920
What happened?

469
00:48:42,220 --> 00:48:47,900
Jo Min Hyuk is reinvestigating the hit-and-run case.

470
00:48:51,130 --> 00:48:52,720
Is that you?

471
00:48:53,230 --> 00:48:54,020
Do Hoon!

472
00:48:54,190 --> 00:48:54,920
Do you feel wronged?

473
00:48:55,090 --> 00:48:55,850
Do Hoon!

474
00:48:56,010 --> 00:48:59,350
How to explain that you are with Jo Min Hyuk all the time?

475
00:49:06,860 --> 00:49:10,320
You don't have to worry about it.

476
00:49:12,720 --> 00:49:14,950
I'm not.

477
00:49:15,890 --> 00:49:18,760
You were the driver.

478
00:49:22,890 --> 00:49:27,840
You made the decision.

479
00:49:28,360 --> 00:49:29,980
So,

480
00:49:32,340 --> 00:49:34,770
Are you here to make sure?

481
00:50:02,590 --> 00:50:04,870
I also want to make sure of something.

482
00:50:06,270 --> 00:50:13,230
That store near the railroad.

483
00:50:14,590 --> 00:50:17,220
The owner saw you.

484
00:50:18,010 --> 00:50:20,250
On the day that my father went missing.

485
00:50:20,810 --> 00:50:23,020
She said you took my father away.

486
00:50:24,200 --> 00:50:26,220
Is that true?

487
00:50:27,040 --> 00:50:28,940
No.

488
00:50:31,070 --> 00:50:33,030
She must've been mistaken.

489
00:50:33,670 --> 00:50:35,550
Really?

490
00:50:37,580 --> 00:50:39,010
Yes.

491
00:50:39,260 --> 00:50:41,420
You're lying.

492
00:50:44,300 --> 00:50:46,980
You're no good at lying.

493
00:51:17,340 --> 00:51:18,790
Yoo Jung!

494
00:51:19,710 --> 00:51:20,880
What now?

495
00:51:20,880 --> 00:51:23,430
What does he want this time?

496
00:51:24,260 --> 00:51:25,260
This time?

497
00:51:25,260 --> 00:51:28,120
The guy who prevented you from getting parole.

498
00:51:28,120 --> 00:51:30,720
What are you talking about?

499
00:51:30,720 --> 00:51:35,520
He aksed me to prevent you from getting parole.

500
00:51:35,520 --> 00:51:37,860
Say that again.

501
00:51:38,180 --> 00:51:40,900
Are you sure?

502
00:51:41,160 --> 00:51:43,640
Are you sure that was him?

503
00:51:43,910 --> 00:51:51,160
Yes. He was the volunteer of our jail.

504
00:53:02,270 --> 00:53:03,880
It's a piece of cake.

505
00:53:03,880 --> 00:53:08,370
I can tell them someone scratched my car, and get the surveillance camera footage.

506
00:53:08,390 --> 00:53:12,020
If he told you to trust him, you can't trust him.

507
00:53:12,020 --> 00:53:16,480
Never trust anyone.

508
00:53:20,320 --> 00:53:21,630
You stay here.

509
00:53:21,630 --> 00:53:25,100
1st of last month, right?

510
00:53:36,550 --> 00:53:37,630
She's not here?

511
00:53:37,630 --> 00:53:40,350
She called in sick.

512
00:53:42,920 --> 00:53:44,370
What's wrong with her?

513
00:53:44,370 --> 00:53:46,250
I don't know.

514
00:53:47,950 --> 00:53:49,840
Check it out.

515
00:53:51,730 --> 00:53:52,810
What?

516
00:53:52,810 --> 00:53:54,890
Nothing.

517
00:55:07,890 --> 00:55:10,770
I also want to make sure of something.

518
00:55:11,580 --> 00:55:17,580
That store near the railroad.

519
00:55:19,220 --> 00:55:22,100
The owner saw you.

520
00:55:23,330 --> 00:55:28,390
She said you took my father away on the day that my father went missing.

521
00:55:41,850 --> 00:55:43,870
Is that true?

522
00:55:46,520 --> 00:55:48,250
You're lying.

523
00:55:50,940 --> 00:55:53,540
You're no good at lying.

524
00:56:19,100 --> 00:56:28,980
Dad! Dad!

525
00:56:33,760 --> 00:56:37,610
It's dangerous for him to go out alone.

526
00:56:37,610 --> 00:56:40,520
This has his information on it.

527
00:56:40,520 --> 00:56:44,590
He can't take it off on his own.

528
00:57:15,530 --> 00:57:19,620
I don't know where my house is. Take me to Yoo Jung.

529
00:57:19,620 --> 00:57:23,020
Yes, Yoo Jung's worried about you. Get in the car.

530
00:57:29,820 --> 00:57:31,830
You still remember that?

531
00:57:31,830 --> 00:57:34,100
Of course.

532
00:57:34,100 --> 00:57:36,360
You thought I don't know that

533
00:57:36,360 --> 00:57:39,850
you drove the car and make Yoo Jung your scapegoat?
